       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Neuroimaging after a TIA"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " too, because infarct, small hemorrhage or mass cannot be excluded clinically; CT may miss infarcts for > 24 hours."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
